    "description": "LetsHub Framework:\n•\tContributed to design and development of the LetsHub framework with web-based admin dashboard, open APIs for chatbots and Android/iOS driver app with Google Maps, services over MongoDB on AWS to handle registration, dispatching, push notifications, task scheduling, reporting, payment handling (Paypal, Stripe), and integration with 3rd party providers (UberRUSH, Eat24, Grubhub, Just Eat, Facebook Messenger)\nFood Dispatch:\n•\tDeveloped an Android app for drivers to track dispatch/delivery with white label, integrated with RESTful APIs and microservices over AWS (Google APIs, PubNub, UberRUSH, Swagger, Node.js)\n•\tDeveloped Facebook Messenger BOTs with white label tailored to each vendor for food orders (Chatfuel, Stripe)\n•\tImplemented UI and dashboard for order management to dispatch on-demand drivers in a shared driver pool (Bootstrap, JS, MongoDB)\n•\tHandled GitLab admins and release engineering for Android apps\nProperty Management:\n•\tDeveloped Facebook Messenger BOTs for tenants to report incidents and issues with integration to LetsHub Framework (Dialogflow/api.ai)\n•\tImplemented UI and dashboard for property management to allow property owners to manage incidents and issues (Bootstrap, JS, MongoDB)\n",
